\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Pipeline of the PCF-CTF framework. Globally available spatial features serve as inputs to GBDT models predicting trip production ($O_i$) and attraction ($A_j$). Distance decay is estimated separately from aggregate distributions. The components are combined via multiplicative gravity fusion to predict zero-shot flow matrices ($T_{ij}$).}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
